{"key": "eval12:eval12@01cfbb1e713f-65e2e1cfdd|explicit", "final": "WITH s1 AS (SELECT observstation AS o, COUNT(*) AS c FROM telescopes GROUP BY observstation), s2 AS (SELECT SUM(c) AS total FROM s1) SELECT s1.o, s1.c, CAST(s1.c AS REAL) / s2.total AS ratio FROM s1 JOIN s2 ON s2.total IS NOT NULL AND s2.total <> 0 ORDER BY ratio DESC LIMIT 10", "turns": 1, "batch_size": 1, "model": "sonnet", "executes": true, "answer": [["Observatory-East Michael                                    ", 3, 0.003161222339304531], ["Observatory-New Michael                                     ", 3, 0.003161222339304531], ["Observatory-East Brett                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-East Jeffrey                                    ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-East Kevin                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-East Samantha                                   ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-Jamesberg                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-Juanville                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-Lake David                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354], ["Observatory-Lake Josephview                                 ", 2, 0.002107481559536354]], "rows_answer": 10}